{"screen_name": "alpacatarojiro", "file": "alpacatarojiro", "name": "北極くまたろ", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2003073878181265408/DtGUaL27.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1686335748000436225/1766405094/1500x500", "description": "成人。お絵描きは一次創作と二次創作ジャンル色々。 skeb一次のみ(close)🖌️ http://skeb.jp/@alpacatarojiro / 🚫生成AIへの使用禁止/使用転載加工禁止/ I do not use generativeAI in my work.", "total_works": 37, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 14000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 14000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 14000, "max": 14000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/alpacatarojiro", "name": "alpacatarojiro"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@taroumarimo3", "name": "taroumarimo3"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://xfolio.jp/portfolio/taroumarimo3", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@alpacatarojiro/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f37b1564/uploads/origins/2aff6ea5-a489-4c30-966b-49bee59133d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff4442d7487d48bf5ff3e96c63c0d941", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f37b1564/uploads/origins/2aff6ea5-a489-4c30-966b-49bee59133d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff4442d7487d48bf5ff3e96c63c0d941, https://si.imgix.net/f37b1564/uploads/origins/2aff6ea5-a489-4c30-966b-49bee59133d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f03d8f910690c744f65994a7bf3d2f76 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f37b1564/uploads/origins/2aff6ea5-a489-4c30-966b-49bee59133d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0564ac2004ee79676966265975563af9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "北極くまたろうさん、ご無沙汰しています、お元気ですか？以前のイラストありがとうございました。また、私のキャラクターのイラストを描いてください。\n\n今回は木造の家の中で、窓辺に座ってオーロラを楽しんでいる彼女を描いてください。テーマが難しければ、冬の夜とオーロラに関するものであれば何でも構いません。\n\n服はリンク先にあるものを参考にしてください。デザインはお好みで調整してください。室内では室内着を、屋外では防寒着を使ってください。\n\n納品時にはレイヤー画像もお願いします。\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YIKol8gnPTz6yXR2SI30Y9i9cGFwZLLB", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@alpacatarojiro/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6536c332/uploads/origins/6fc5b179-229b-4b54-b743-2b7032b88fd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=45b55cd36db0116eeede1cff8b88ac12", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6536c332/uploads/origins/6fc5b179-229b-4b54-b743-2b7032b88fd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=45b55cd36db0116eeede1cff8b88ac12, https://si.imgix.net/6536c332/uploads/origins/6fc5b179-229b-4b54-b743-2b7032b88fd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9145749721470d791ecb512cd1fc5acb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6536c332/uploads/origins/6fc5b179-229b-4b54-b743-2b7032b88fd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=91517e1e32b2c611e8a842161971b09c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@alpacatarojiro/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d23a899/uploads/origins/6559d3fc-07b9-4ed9-8c1a-eff7344685ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e9d1da4f24084623ec27a5d8fdf6ef26", "thumbnail_src